nd Intimacy#Key Exchanges#{5}":[47,47],"#Post-Rescue Surrender and Intimacy#Key Exchanges#{6}":[48,48],"#Post-Rescue Surrender and Intimacy#Key Exchanges#{7}":[49,50],"#Post-Rescue Surrender and Intimacy#Outcome & Continuity":[51,59],"#Post-Rescue Surrender and Intimacy#Outcome & Continuity#{1}":[52,52],"#Post-Rescue Surrender and Intimacy#Outcome & Continuity#{2}":[53,53],"#Post-Rescue Surrender and Intimacy#Outcome & Continuity#{3}":[54,54],"#Post-Rescue Surrender and Intimacy#Outcome & Continuity#{4}":[55,55],"#Post-Rescue Surrender and Intimacy#Outcome & Continuity#{5}":[56,56],"#Post-Rescue Surrender and Intimacy#Outcome & Continuity#{6}":[57,57],"#Post-Rescue Surrender and Intimacy#Outcome & Continuity#{7}":[58,58],"#Post-Rescue Surrender and Intimacy#Outcome & Continuity#{8}":[59,59]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":50,"tags":["#lorebook"],"keys":["Charlotte Claymore","Ryan Adame","Loren Claymore","marriage contract","post-rescue","identity fragmentation","weaponize persona","marriage contract amendment","confinement restraint","lavender soap"],"position":"after","depth":4,"summary":"This entry documents a pivotal intimate encounter between Ryan Adame and Countess Charlotte Claymore, occurring immediately after Alec Hamilton's rescue. It details a shift in their relationship, where Ryan uses controlled physical dominance to dismantle Charlotte's emotional defenses, securing her confession of love and commitment to her long-term trauma recovery. Key dynamics include the activation of the marriage contract amendment granting Charlotte choice, the identification of her identity fragmentation from Loren's manipulation, and Ryan establishing a new relational paradigm of dominan"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Flora - Memory Books/Arcs/[ARC 012] - Post-Rescue Surrender and Intimacy.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":"1eo5m0q","at":1777331884024},"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-